# Pipeline timestamps

## Single source of truth

`packages/data/cache/normalized/meta/pipeline.json` — update via `writePipelineMeta()` in `packages/data/src/pipeline-meta.ts`.

| Field | Set by |
| ----- | ------ |
| `extractedAt` | `scripts/1-extract/index.ts` (includes evolution-chains materialization) |
| `transformedAt` | `scripts/3-transform/index.ts` |
| `cardsMergedAt` | `scripts/3-transform/1-pokemon/06-transform-pokemon-cards.ts` |
| `refreshedAt` | `scripts/3-transform/index.ts` (prices group) |
| `bulbapediaIllustratorsCatalogAt` | `scripts/3-transform/2-meta/02-transform-bulbapedia-illustrators.ts` |
| `bulbapediaExpansionsCatalogAt` | `scripts/3-transform/2-meta/03-transform-bulbapedia-expansions.ts` |
| `competitiveAppliedAt` | `scripts/3-transform/1-pokemon/09-apply-competitive.ts` |
| `tcgTypeProfilesAppliedAt` | `scripts/3-transform/1-pokemon/07-transform-tcg-type-profile.ts` |
| `illustratorTcgIndexAt` | `scripts/3-transform/3-prices/05-refresh-illustrator-tcg-cache.ts` |

App-facing “when was data built?” → `readPipelineMeta()` / `resolvePipelineExtractedAt()`.

## Never duplicate on entity files

Do **not** add run timestamps to:

- `meta/evolution-chains/{id}.json`
- `meta/cards/expansions/{slug}/info.json`, `meta/cards/illustrators/{slug}/info.json`
- Per-species `species.json`, `cards.json`, `images.json`, `lore.json`
- `meta/illustrators-catalog.json`, `meta/expansions-catalog.json`, `meta/cards/illustrators/index.json`

Forbidden keys: `extractedAt`, `transformedAt`, `generatedAt`, `enrichedAt`, `tcgTypeProfileEnrichedAt`.

`stripAllCommittedNormalizedTimestamps()` runs at the start of every `transform` (includes evolution-chains cleanup).

## Where timestamps are allowed

| Location | Purpose |
| -------- | ------- |
| `cache/normalized/meta/pipeline.json` | Global pipeline runs (committed) |
| `cache/extract-manifest.json` | Per-source extract stats (gitignored) |
| `cache/raw/**` | Per-record extract time (gitignored) |

Per-entity freshness → content hashes or `schemaVersion`, not `new Date()` on every file.
